  "about": {
    "zh": {
      "title": "团队简介",
      "html": "<h2>秦罗万象</h2>\n<blockquote><p>秦月照研路，罗星汇万象。</p></blockquote>\n<p>「秦罗万象」是一个由<strong>罗朝广（Chaoguang Luo）</strong>与<strong>秦勇（Yong Qin）</strong>两位学者组成的学术研究团队。团队名取两位学者姓氏首字「秦」「罗」，寓意「秦月照研路，罗星汇万象」——以月光喻治学之沉静照亮，以星罗喻万象之汇聚交融。</p>\n<h3>我们做什么（使命草稿 · 待 owner 审）</h3>\n<p>我们以严谨、开放、可复现的方法开展学术研究，关注管理与数据科学交叉领域的真实问题，并在此记录与分享团队的研究进展与思考。</p>\n<p>研究方向详述待两位学者履历确认后补充，本页不做虚构展开。</p>\n<h3>关于本站</h3>\n<p>本站是「秦罗万象」团队的公开学术窗口。初衷很朴素：给两位学者的长期协作一个稳定、可积累的地方，把散落的研究线索整理成清晰、可回看的记录，而不是让它们停留在聊天记录与临时文件里。</p>\n<p>我们希望在这里持续做三件事：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>记录进展</strong>：按时间沉淀研究问题、阶段性结论与尚未解答的疑问，允许回头检视每一步是怎么走过来的。</li>\n<li><strong>分享方法</strong>：公开可复现的思路、工具与写作过程，让交流不止停留在结论层面。</li>\n<li><strong>连接同行</strong>：为关注管理与数据科学交叉议题的读者，提供一个可靠、可追溯的接触入口。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本站坚持一条底线：只写能够核实的内容。未经本人确认的履历与成果不预填，草稿与暂译会明确标注，方便读者判断信息的可信程度。导航提供中英双语与明暗主题，选择保存在本机浏览器，下次访问自动沿用。</p>\n<h3>联系</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>公开交流：欢迎在 <a href=\"https://github.com/domagic/domagic.github.io\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">GitHub 仓库</a> 提交 Issue，用于勘误、讨论与合作意向。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>邮件联系：秦勇 yongqin_ahsc@163.com；罗朝广 chaoguangluo@outlook.com。</p>"
    },
    "en": {
      "title": "About the Group",
      "html": "<h2>Qin-Luo Research Group</h2>\n<p><em>English group name is provisional (pending final decision).</em></p>\n<blockquote><p>The Qin moon lights the path of inquiry; the Luo stars gather all phenomena. <em>(Draft translation of the group couplet 「秦月照研路，罗星汇万象」; wording pending review.)</em></p></blockquote>\n<p>The <strong>Qin-Luo Research Group</strong> is an academic research team formed by two scholars, <strong>Chaoguang Luo (罗朝广)</strong> and <strong>Yong Qin (秦勇)</strong>. The Chinese name 「秦罗万象」 takes the first characters of the two scholars' surnames, evoking the couplet above: moonlight as the quiet illumination of scholarship, and a canopy of stars as the gathering of all phenomena.</p>\n<h3>What we do (mission draft, pending review)</h3>\n<p>We pursue rigorous, open, and reproducible research on real-world questions at the intersection of management and data science, and we share our progress and reflections here.</p>\n<p>Detailed research directions will be added once both scholars' profiles are confirmed; nothing is fabricated here.</p>\n<h3>About this site</h3>\n<p>This site is the public academic window of the Qin-Luo Research Group. It exists for a simple reason: to give two scholars' long-term collaboration a stable, cumulative home, where scattered research threads can be organised into a clear record that is easy to revisit — instead of being left in chat threads and temporary files.</p>\n<p>We try to keep doing three things here:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Record progress</strong>: keep research questions, interim findings and open problems in a time-ordered archive, so that each step can be examined later.</li>\n<li><strong>Share methods</strong>: make reproducible ideas, tools and the writing process visible, not only the conclusions.</li>\n<li><strong>Connect</strong>: offer a reliable, traceable entry point for readers interested in the intersection of management and data science.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The site follows one rule: publish only what can be verified. Unconfirmed biographies or results are never pre-filled, and draft or provisional material is labelled as such so readers can judge how much to rely on it. Navigation supports Chinese and English as well as light/dark themes; your choice is stored locally and restored on your next visit.</p>\n<h3>Contact</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Public conversation: open an issue in the <a href=\"https://github.com/domagic/domagic.github.io\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">GitHub repository</a> for corrections, discussion or collaboration enquiries.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Email: Yong Qin — yongqin_ahsc@163.com; Chaoguang Luo — chaoguangluo@outlook.com.</p>"
    }
  },
